ance/src/commit/9084720dc6a7fbf1d3f358919d46bd6adfb55287/AIAgreement.md).\r\n\r\n### Tests for Go changes\r\n\r\n(can be removed for JavaScript changes)\r\n\r\n### Documentation\r\n\r\n- [ ] I created a pull request [to the documentation](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/docs) to explain to Forgejo users how to use this change.\r\n- [x] I did not document these changes and I do not expect someone else to do it.\r\n\r\n### Release notes\r\n\r\n- [x] This change will be noticed by a Forgejo user or admin (feature, bug fix, performance, etc.). I suggest to include a release note for this change.\r\n- [ ] This change is not visible to a Forgejo user or admin (refactor, dependency upgrade, etc.). I think there is no need to add a release note for this change.\r\n\r\n*The decision if the pull request will be shown in the release notes is up to the mergers / release team.*\r\n\r\nThe content of the `release-notes/\u003cpull request number\u003e.md` file will serve as the basis for the release notes. If the file does not exist, the title of the pull request will be used instead.\r\n","labels":[{"id":78139,"name":"enhancement/feature","exclusive":false,"is_archived":false,"color":"207de5","description":"New feature","url":"https://codeberg.org/api/v1/repos/forgejo/forgejo/labels/78139"},{"id":87703,"name":"forgejo/ui","exclusive":false,"is_archived":false,"color":"eb6420","description":"User interface","url":"https://codeberg.org/api/v1/repos/forgejo/forgejo/labels/87703"},{"id":201029,"name":"test/not-needed","exclusive":true,"is_archived":false,"color":"5319e7","description":"no additional test is needed","url":"https://codeberg.org/api/v1/repos/forgejo/forgejo/labels/201029"}],"milestone":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":null,"requested_reviewers":[{"id":39134,"login":"Beowulf","login_name":"","source_id":0,"full_name":"","email":"beowulf@noreply.codeberg.org","avatar_url":"https://codeberg.org/avatars/9c5157f1643b677db67053592f8d2471","html_url":"https://codeberg.org/Beowulf