w":0},{"id":3257988,"url":"https://codeberg.org/api/v1/repos/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/14598","number":14598,"user":{"id":1492366,"login":"peter-mueller","login_name":"","source_id":0,"full_name":"","email":"peter-mueller@noreply.codeberg.org","avatar_url":"https://codeberg.org/avatars/a9fde78d601f6ae7a72af7d7e2e305d5d1de6381d7f20c845d78f89cf60d493d","html_url":"https://codeberg.org/peter-mueller","language":"","is_admin":false,"last_login":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","created":"2026-09-21T11:36:00+02:00","restricted":false,"active":false,"prohibit_login":false,"location":"","pronouns":"","website":"","description":"","visibility":"public","followers_count":0,"following_count":0,"starred_repos_count":0,"username":"peter-mueller"},"title":"sort user repositories alphabetically and make input searchable","body":"Implements forgejo/forgejo#14366\r\n\r\n- sort repositories alphabetically\r\n- make input searchable\r\n\r\nSetup Testdata:\r\n- create empty repo named \"a\"\r\n- create empty repo named \"z\"\r\n- create empty repo named \"ba\"\r\n- create empty repo named \"0\"\r\n- create empty repo named \"999\"\r\n- create package \"test\"\r\n  - `touch package.txt`  \r\n  - `curl --user peter:peterpeter --upload-file package.txt http://localhost:3000/api/packages/peter/generic/test/1.0/package.txt`\r\n\r\n```\r\nexport FJ_API=http://localhost:3000/api/v1\r\nexport FJ_API_V0=http://localhost:3000/api\r\nexport FJ_USER=peter:peterpeter\r\n\r\ncurl --user $FJ_USER -X POST $FJ_API/user/repos --json '{ \"name\": \"a\" }' \r\ncurl --user $FJ_USER -X POST $FJ_API/user/repos --json '{ \"name\": \"z\" }'\r\ncurl --user $FJ_USER -X POST $FJ_API/user/repos --json '{ \"name\": \"ba\" }'\r\ncurl --user $FJ_USER -X POST $FJ_API/user/repos --json '{ \"name\": \"0\" }'\r\ncurl --user $FJ_USER -X POST $FJ_API/user/repos --json '{ \"name\": \"999\" }'\r\n\r\ntouch package.txt\r\ncurl --user $FJ_USER --upload-file package.txt $FJ_API_V0/packages/peter/generic/test/1.0/package.txt\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nUI-Test:\r\n- click avatar icon\r\n- click \"Profile\"\r\n- click \"Packages\"\r\n- click package \"test\"\r\n- click \"Settings\" (right bottom)\r\n- click \"Select repository\" \r\n\r\nExpected:\r\nPackage are ordered alphabetically as:\r\n- \"0\"\r\n- \"999\"\r\n- \"a\"\r\n- \"b\"\r\n- \"z\"\r\n\r\n\r\n## Checklist\r\n\r\nThe [contributor guide](https://forgejo.org/docs/next/contributor/) contains information that will be helpful to first time contributors. All work and communication must conform to Forgejo's [AI Agreement](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/governance/src/branch/main/AIAgreement.md). There also are a few [conditions for merging Pull Requests in Forgejo repositories](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/governance/src/branch/main/PullRequestsAgreement.md). You are also welcome to join the [Forgejo development chatroom](https://matrix.to/#/#forgejo-development:matrix.org).\r\n\r\n### Compliance\r\n\r\n- [x] I confirm that I make this contribution in accordance with [Forgejo's AI Agreement](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/governance/src/commit/9084720dc6a7fbf1d3f358919d46bd6adfb55287/AIAgreement.md).\r\n\r\n### Tests for Go changes\r\n\r\n(can be removed for JavaScript changes)\r\n\r\n- I added test coverage for Go changes...\r\n  - [ ] in their respective `*_test.go` for unit tests.\r\n  - [ ] in the `tests/integration` directory if it involves interactions with a live Forgejo server.\r\n- I ran...\r\n  - [ ] `make pr-go` before pushing\r\n\r\n### Documentation\r\n\r\n- [ ] I created a pull request [to the documentation](https://codeberg.org/forgejo/docs) to explain to Forgejo users how to use this change.\r\n- [x] I did not document these changes and I do not expect someone else to do it.\r\n\r\n### Release notes\r\n\r\n- [x] This change will be noticed by a Forgejo user or admin (feature, bug fix, performance, etc.). I suggest to include a release note for this change.\r\n- [ ] This change is not visible to a Forgejo user or admin (refactor, dependency upgrade, etc.). I think there is no need to add a release note for this change.\r\n\r\n*The decision if the pull request will be shown in the release notes is up to the mergers / release team.*\r\n\r\nThe content of the `release-notes/\u003cpull request number\u003e.md` file will serve as the basis for the release notes. If the file does not exist, the title of the pull request will be used instead.\r\n","labels":[{"id":441003,"name":"code/packages","exclusive":false,"is_archived":false,"color":"eb6420","description":"Forgejo package and container registry","url":"https://codeberg.org/api/v1/repos/forgejo/forgejo/labels/441003"},{"id":87703,"name":"forgejo/ui","exclusive":false,"is_archived":false,"color":"eb6420","description":"User interface","url":"https://codeberg.org/api/v1/repos/forgejo/forgejo/labels/87703"},{"id":201028,"name":"test/manual","exclusive":true,"is_archived":false,"color":"5319e7","description":"manual testing has been documented","url":"https://codeberg.org/api/v1/repos/forgejo/forgejo/labels/201028"}],"milestone":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":null,"requested_reviewers":[{"id":39134,"login":"Beowulf","login_name":"","source_id":0,"full_name":"","email":"beowulf@noreply.codeberg.org","avatar_url":"https://codeberg.org/avatars/9c5157f1643b677db67053592f8d2471","html_url":"https://codeberg.org/Beowulf","language":"","is_admin":false,"last_login":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","created":"2022-02-06T18:54:57+01:00","restricted":false,"active":false,"prohibit_login":false,"location":"","pronouns":"any pronouns","website":"","description":"\u003ca rel=\"me\" href=\"https://beosocial.de/@beowulf\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eJust hacking on fun things...","visibility":"public","followers_count":20,"following_count":2,"starred_repos_count":7,"username":"Beowulf"},{"id":26734,"login":"Gusted","login_name":"","source_id":0,"full_name":"","email":"gusted@noreply.codeberg.org","avatar_url":"https://codeberg.org/avatars/44a59264e976fa585ed9f0a92abad9d7","html_url":"https://codeb